# Licence and provenance of the sample works

The three sample works (`shonen-rooftop`, `shojo-afterschool`, `koma-morning`) are original fiction. The stories, characters, names and dialogue were written for this
repository; they depict no existing work or person.

## Licence

Everything under `samples/` (page images, scripts, ground truth, direction files) is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
Raw output of an image model may not be protected by copyright; CC0 is used so that nothing is left unclear. The lettering, layout and effects are code-drawn and are dedicated with it.

A machine-readable list of the works, their pages and licence is in `samples/manifest.json`; checksums are in `samples/MANIFEST.sha256`
(that file also lists the demo media under `docs/media/`, which have their own note in `docs/media/README.md`).

## How the pages were made (`tools/sample_gen/`)

- Panel art: Qwen-Image (Alibaba / Qwen team), licence Apache-2.0, https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image (revision 75e0b4be04 read on 2026-10-22; licence file and model card state Apache-2.0).
  Weights used: the ComfyUI repackaging https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI (Apache-2.0, revision 1f12b17be1): `qwen_image_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors`,
  `qwen_image_vae.safetensors`, and the text encoder `qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (Qwen2.5-VL-7B, Apache-2.0).
  Sampler: euler, simple scheduler, 20 steps, CFG 2.5, AuraFlow shift 3.1, through ComfyUI. Each panel's prompt and seed are in `<work>/script.yaml`. No prompt names an artist, franchise or character; a test checks this.
- Everything else is drawn by `tools/sample_gen/render.py`: panel layout, borders, halftone tone from the generated gray values, balloons, tails, lettering, sound effects and manpu.
  `<work>/truth.json` holds the exact panel polygons, unit boxes, label masks (`truth/*_units.png`), text and reading order.
- Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, downloaded at build time and not redistributed here; only rendered glyphs appear in the pages):

| family | source | sha256 of the file used |
