Not used: fonts whose licence restricts redistribution of rendered text or the font itself.

## Regenerating

`python -m tools.sample_gen.build art <work>...` writes the art stage for the GPU runner; `python -m tools.sample_gen.build render <work>... --art DIR` assembles pages and truth.
